relation to wider research.”\n\nOverall alignment read: directionally strong, but still pre-publication. The portfolio is pointed at the north star, yet nothing has shipped, so there is still no recorded reproducible observation or honest published account. “Task counts do not count,” so the 0 shipped/week metric is not the substance of the score; the substance is that the current work is all preparatory, and LH001, the “standard candle,” is not visible in the roadmap."}

